<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px',
  height: '720px',
  background: '#0A0F1E',
  padding: '40px 64px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  <Text style={{
    fontSize: 34,
    fontWeight: 'bold',
    color: '#F8FAFC',
    marginBottom: 24,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif',
  }}>
    冒险模式 · Roguelike 即时战斗让刷题更上瘾
  </Text>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    gap: 28,
    flex: 1,
    alignItems: 'stretch',
  }}>
    <Box style={{
      width: 360,
      flexDirection: 'column',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      gap: 18,
    }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#C7D0E0', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
        把答题正确率转化为战斗伤害，答错则扣血；爬塔、Boss、奖励节点、被动技能树让备考像游戏一样有反馈。
      </Text>
      {[
        { title: '即时战斗', desc: '每题即一回合，伤害实时结算' },
        { title: '28 个被动技能', desc: '攻击 / 法术 / 防御 / 续航四大树' },
        { title: '升级三选一', desc: '每层奖励节点抽技能，策略组合' },
        { title: '主动技 · 虚空魔弹', desc: '消耗蓝量穿透全场，冷却 8 拍' },
      ].map((c, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{
          background: '#131C33',
          borderRadius: 14,
          padding: 16,
          flexDirection: 'column',
          gap: 4,
          borderLeft: '3px solid #D4AF37',
        }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F8FAFC' }}>{c.title}</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>{c.desc}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
    <Box style={{
      flex: 1,
      background: '#131C33',
      borderRadius: 20,
      padding: 10,
      border: '1px solid rgba(37,99,235,0.2)',
      justifyContent: 'center',
      alignItems: 'center',
    }}>
      <Image
        src="assets/07_roguelike.png"
        style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 12 }}
      />
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{
    flexDirection: 'row',
    justifyContent: 'space-between',
    marginTop: 24,
  }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>金瑞升学 · 金鹰系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A89A3' }}>11 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
